Title: Any user can read any account
Scenario:
```
An authenticated user requests /accounts/42 for an account owned by someone else: #[MapEntity] loads it from the id and nothing checks that the current user owns it, so the page discloses the account of another customer.
```
Remediation:
```
Deny access unless the current user may view the account, with a voter: #[IsGranted('ACCOUNT_VIEW', 'account')] on the action.
```
